# Per-store cross-browser packages are COMMITTED (not ignored) from v1.1.3 on,
# so every release tag carries the exact Chrome/Edge/Firefox uploads. Rebuild
# them with `bun run build:crossbrowser` whenever extension/ changes.

# Chrome-generated DNR ruleset index (created when loading unpacked ext)
extension/_metadata/

